  "notes": "AXILO 78 plinth legs (owner's choice, docs/benchtops.md). A set is a tube with its adjusting foot and a mounting plate (the glide) that screws or knocks into the carcass bottom; the tube clips up into the plate, so the leg stands its nominal height, adjustable -10/+20 mm. Tube articles are known only for the sets downloaded so far. Not verified by a person. Häfele's data for the 100 mm sets (637.76.404, .405) supplies tube 637.76.352, which measures 80 long, so there is no 100 tube row yet: ask Häfele.",
